      <slug></slug>
      <title>XWT</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;XWT is a new cross platform GUI toolkit for Mono and .NET, which is based on the idea of building an abstract widget library on top of platform-specific native widgets. This toolkit is still in a very early development stage, but there are already backends for GTK+, MonoMac and some initial work on WPF. The talk will explain the goals of the project and some details about design principles and internal architecture.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2521">Lluis Sanchez</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>